[rocprofiler-sdk] add missing stl headers

These missing includes became apparent when building with
ROCPROFILER_BUILD_GHC_FS=OFF.

NOTE(rocm-10): rebased for therock-10.0 — dropped the test-only status.cpp
hunk (tests are off by default) and re-placed the <fstream>/<array>/<memory>
includes whose surrounding include lists drifted upstream, and added <fstream>
to the new rocattach/auxv.cpp (std::ifstream, undefined under LLVM 23 libc++).
